return [====["><p>Expanded Instruction Booklet · September 2026</p></article><article class="page" id="welcome" data-title="Deborah is waiting!"><div class="kicker">How to play</div><h2>Deborah is waiting!</h2><div role="img" aria-label="Deborah demonstrates" class="art" style="background-size:300% 200%;background-position:0% 0%"></div><p>Somewhere inside a towering prison of shipping containers, Deborah is waiting for you. The passages change. The guards grow stronger. The Warden has a toilet. You have thirty minutes.</p><p>Gather one to four Heroes, cross the colored gates, hunt down the Black Keycard, and defeat Gordon. Levels 1–19 rescue nineteen different damsels; Level 1 begins with Nessa. Deborah herself waits at Level 20, where Hector the Director stands between Gordon’s defeat and her rescue. From Level 21 onward, Gordon steals cash instead. SECURE THE BAG, then see how far the server can go!</p><p>This booklet uses the game&#x27;s default keyboard and mouse controls. Its little-console-booklet look is a tribute; your adventure runs in Garry&#x27;s Mod. Rebound game actions follow your configured bindings.</p><blockquote>“You brought a rescue party. Good. Now bring a plan.”<br>— Deborah</blockquote><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 2</div></article><article class="page" id="quick-start" data-title="Your first rescue"><div class="kicker">How to play</div><h2>Your first rescue</h2><div role="img" aria-label="Deborah demonstrates" class="art" style="background-size:300% 200%;background-position:50% 0%"></div><ol><li>In staging, visit the Hermit. Choose Fighter, Rogue, or Wizard and settle your first feat choice. Collect your starter weapon.</li><li>Press P to inspect your character. Use Equipment to choose gear, and I to set your spell. Read any unfamiliar effect before entering.</li><li>Use the portal. The first Hero entering each dungeon starts its 30:00 collapse clock.</li><li>Find the cards and open their gates: Red, Blue, Yellow, then Black. Neil carries the Black Keycard.</li><li>Defeat Gordon; at Level 20, also defeat Hector’s Director’s Heart in the court. Collect the Jail Key at the arena center, open the rescue chamber, then touch or use the current damsel to complete the level. From Level 21, recover the marked cash case instead.</li></ol><blockquote>“Beating the Warden isn&#x27;t the rescue. Come and get me!”<br>— Deborah</blockquote><div class="folio">THE LEGEND OF DEBORAH · 3</di]====]
